    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "43a7d07c6af436c3ac612dad473adb0b3c4c91907785fd7da2d7a0dbdcb2e975",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Two group excursions with an English-speaking guide are included in the day’s programme. The Small Circuit follows an approximately 65 km route by car around Bariloche, stopping at Playa Bonita with views of Huemul Island and ascending Cerro Campanario, 1,050 m.\n\nFrom the summit, you can see Lakes Moreno and Nahuel Huapi, El Trébol Lagoon, the San Pedro and Llao Llao peninsulas, Victoria Island and the peaks of Otto, López, Goye and Cerro Catedral. Then take a catamaran to Victoria Island and the Arrayanes myrtle forest. Both excursions are listed for the same day; the order is confirmed when booking. Overnight at Rochester Bariloche 4*.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261104-ddc12b513de4",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word paragraphs 103–105 cover both excursions, but omit the RU booking-order condition and name Design Suites Bariloche in paragraph 146 instead of Rochester; translated frozen RU and flagged hotel discrepancy for master."
      }
